<title>RUSSIA: Rouble dips to 5,434 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble dips to 5,434 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble eased to 5,434 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,426 on Monday. Dealers said the central bank bought $0.52 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Oct 15		  Oct 14</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,434		   5,426</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	4.59		    2.54</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
